<title>SINGAPORE: HPL forms health, beauty spa subsidiary.</title>
<headline>HPL forms health, beauty spa subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hotel Plaza Limited (HPL) said on Monday it had created a wholly-owned subsidiary company, St Gregory Spa Pte Ltd, with an authorised share capital of Singapore $5 million.</p>
<p>HPL said in a statement to the stock exchange that St Gregory Spa will operate health and beauty spa retreats and facilities in Singapore.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
</text>
